Yilin Wu, Ran Tian, Gokul Swamy, and Andrea Bajcsy.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">From foresight to forethought: Vlm-in-the-loop policy steering via latent alignment.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">In <em id="bib.bib50.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Robotics: Science and Systems (RSS)</em>, 2025.

</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib51" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">[51]</span>
