<span class="ltx_bibblock">Playworld: Learning robot world models from autonomous play.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><em id="bib.bib51.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">CoRR</em>, abs/2603.09030, 2026.

</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib52" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">[52]</span>
